# Inline field action buttons

When an **action button** sits on the **same horizontal row** as a form control (text input, readonly value, `app-money-input`, `p-select`, etc.), the button must use **`size="small"`** on `p-button` / `pButton`.

Typical actions: **Save**, **Copy**, **Add**, **Link**, **Save Rate**, **Use** (suggested value).

## Do

- Wrap the control + button in **`.field-action-row`** (`admin/src/assets/layout/_form-layout.scss`).
- `size="small"` on every action button in that row.
- Icon-only inline actions (copy, remove on a dropzone row) also use `size="small"` when they are `p-button`.

## Do not

- `class="p-button-sm"` — use `size="small"` (PrimeNG 21).
- Default/large buttons squeezed beside a single-line field.
- Apply to **dialog footers**, **page toolbars** (New … next to title), **form-actions** Save at the bottom of a form, or **table row ⋮ menus** — those keep their normal sizes unless product says otherwise.

